-1500x653.png?h=70&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" alt="Extend" class="GK011G_logo"/></div><a class="GK011G_logoWrapper GK011G_logoLink" href="/customer-stories/peerbound"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/f7f525b6a44e0765e42f1f12259daa83ab74bbf8-1024x192.png?h=70&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" alt="Peerbound" class="GK011G_logo"/><span class="GK011G_caption">Case Study<svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11L11 5M11 5H6.5M11 5V9.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section></div><div class="page-module"><section class="ooKi2G_users "><div class="ooKi2G_inner"><div class="ooKi2G_header"><p class="ooKi2G_eyebrow">/the web access layer for agents</p><h2 class="ooKi2G_heading">Loved by developers, built for enterprises</h2></div><div class="ooKi2G_highlights"><article class="ooKi2G_highlight "><div class="ooKi2G_preview" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ooKi2G_previewSurface ooKi2G_contextPreview "><div class="ooKi2G_contextStage"><div class="ooKi2G_toolInvocation"><code>tavily.search(<span class="ooKi2G_toolArgumentLine"></span>)</code></div><div class="ooKi2G_resultsFeed"><header class="ooKi2G_feedHeader"><small class="ooKi2G_feedLabel">Found sources</small><span class="ooKi2G_toolTimer"></span></header><div class="ooKi2G_feedRow ooKi2G_sourceSelected"><span></span><div class="ooKi2G_sourceBody"><strong></strong></div><div class="ooKi2G_sourceChunks"><small>Relevant chunks</small><b></b><b></b><b></b></div></div><div class="ooKi2G_feedRow ooKi2G_sourceDiscarded"><span></span><div class="ooKi2G_sourceBody"><strong></strong></div></div><div class="ooKi2G_feedRow ooKi2G_sourceSelected"><span></span><div class="ooKi2G_sourceBody"><strong></strong></div><div class="ooKi2G_sourceChunks"><small>Relevant chunks</small><b></b><b></b></div></div><div class="ooKi2G_feedRow ooKi2G_sourceDiscarded"><span></span><div class="ooKi2G_sourceBody"><strong></strong></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ooKi2G_content"><h3 class="ooKi2G_title">Ground models with fresh web context</h3><p class="ooKi2G_description">Retrieve live web data, extract relevant content, and return it structured and chunked for models, so agents reason over facts without hallucinating.</p></div></article><article class="ooKi2G_highlight ooKi2G_highlightReversed"><div class="ooKi2G_preview" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ooKi2G_previewSurface ooKi2G_throughputPreview "><div class="ooKi2G_throughputConsole"><div class="ooKi2G_convergenceFocus"><div class="ooKi2G_convergenceDiagram" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ooKi2G_convergenceLines ooKi2G_sourceLines" viewBox="0 0 1000 360" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="ooKi2G_convergencePath undefined " d="M0 86 C180 86 280 180 500 180"></path><path class="ooKi2G_convergencePath undefined ooKi2G_middleSourcePath" d="M0 180 H500"></path><path class="ooKi2G_convergencePath undefined " d="M0 274 C180 274 280 180 500 180"></path></svg><svg class="ooKi2G_convergenceLines ooKi2G_responseLines" viewBox="0 0 1000 360" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="ooKi2G_convergencePath ooKi2G_responsePath" d="M500 180 H1000"></path></svg><div class="ooKi2G_requestDots"><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotTop ooKi2G_flowDotEcho"></span><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotTop"></span><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotMiddle"></span><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotBottom"></span><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotBottom ooKi2G_flowDotEcho"></span><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotResponse"></span><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotResponse ooKi2G_flowDotResponseTrail"></span><span class="ooKi2G_flowDot ooKi2G_flowDotResponse ooKi2G_flowDotResponseEcho"></span></div><div class="ooKi2G_mergeMark"><img src="/logos/tavily-mark-black.svg" alt=""/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ooKi2G_content"><h3 class="ooKi2G_title">Handle thousands of web queries in seconds</h3><p class="ooKi2G_description">A production-grade retrieval stack with real-time search, intelligent caching, and indexing keeps latency predictable as traffic grows.</p></div></article><article class="ooKi2G_highlight "><div class="ooKi2G_preview" aria-hidden="true"><div class="DKHo9G_surface"><div class="DKHo9G_stage"><div class="DKHo9G_policy"><strong class="DKHo9G_policyLabel"></strong><span class="DKHo9G_progressTrack"></span></div><code class="DKHo9G_payload"><span class="DKHo9G_brace">{</span><span class="DKHo9G_line DKHo9G_lineHidden"><b>&quot;query&quot;</b><span class="DKHo9G_muted">:</span><em class="DKHo9G_queryValue"><span class="DKHo9G_muted">&quot;</span><span class="DKHo9G_ghost"></span><strong class="DKHo9G_pii "><span class="DKHo9G_mask"></span>hello@company.com</strong><span class="DKHo9G_ghost DKHo9G_ghostShort"></span><span class="DKHo9G_muted">&quot;,</span></em></span><span class="DKHo9G_line DKHo9G_lineHidden"><b>&quot;search_depth&quot;</b><span class="DKHo9G_muted">:</span><span class="DKHo9G_skeleton"></span><span class="DKHo9G_muted">,</span></span><span class="DKHo9G_line DKHo9G_lineHidden"><b>&quot;max_results&quot;</b><span class="DKHo9G_muted">:</span><span class="DKHo9G_skeleton DKHo9G_skeletonShort"></span><span class="DKHo9G_muted">,</span></span><span class="DKHo9G_line DKHo9G_lineHidden"><b>&quot;include_answer&quot;</b><span class="DKHo9G_muted">:</span><span class="DKHo9G_skeleton"></span></span><span class="DKHo9G_errorLine "><b>&quot;error&quot;</b><span class="DKHo9G_muted">:</span><em class="DKHo9G_errorValue"><span class="DKHo9G_muted">&quot;</span><span class="DKHo9G_errorText"></span><span class="DKHo9G_errorPending">Query blocked, PII detected with type: EMAIL</span><span class="DKHo9G_errorPending">&quot;</span></em></span><span class="DKHo9G_brace">}</span></code></div></div></div><div class="ooKi2G_content"><h3 class="ooKi2G_title">Ship to production with built-in safeguards</h3><p class="ooKi2G_description">Requests pass through security, privacy, and content validation layers that block PII leakage, prompt injection, and malicious sources.</p></div></article></div></div></section></div><div class="page-module"><section><div class="vZSxqa_container"><div class="vZSxqa_securityGrid"><div class="vZSxqa_securityCopy"><span class="vZSxqa_eyebrow">/security</span><h2 class="vZSxqa_title">Enterprise-grade security, built in.</h2></div><ul class="vZSxqa_securityBadges" data-count="4"><li class="vZSxqa_securityBadge"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/36b511f0b167d31a3d615f08f6b846e57d6c8035-58x58.svg" alt="SOC 2" width="58" height="58" loading="lazy" class="vZSxqa_securityBadgeImage"/></li><li class="vZSxqa_securityBadge"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/095ba4bd0869ff34be7ebc664e1311f20472cc60-38x56.svg" alt="ZDR" width="38" height="56" loading="lazy" class="vZSxqa_securityBadgeImage"/></li><li class="vZSxqa_securityBadge"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/643869df56ef620be654292e8932ea895d978a66-65x62.svg" alt="GDPR" width="65" height="62" loading="lazy" class="vZSxqa_securityBadgeImage"/></li><li class="vZSxqa_securityBadge"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/81d4ad571d6427f9fc54cbb2142f969e11c4c9d2-41x53.svg" alt="ISO 27001" width="41" height="53" loading="lazy" class="vZSxqa_securityBadgeImage"/></li></ul></div></div></section></div><div class="page-module"><section class="_9KQG9q_section"><div class="_9KQG9q_header"><div class="_9KQG9q_headerText"><p class="_9KQG9q_eyebrow">/customers</p><h2 class="_9KQG9q_heading">Teams ship on Tavily</h2></div><a class="QdTX5q_button QdTX5q_primary _9KQG9q_cta" href="/customer-stories"><span class="QdTX5q_content"><span class="QdTX5q_label">View all stories</span></span><span class="QdTX5q_border" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div><ul class="_9KQG9q_grid"><li class="_9KQG9q_cell _9KQG9q_cellVideo"><div class="_9KQG9q_card _9KQG9q_video"><div class="_9KQG9q_previewFrame"><video poster="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/1ae1f01cc13add0362125721f25b9a18c380893d-1920x1080.jpg?w=1600&amp;h=900&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" muted="" loop="" playsInline="" preload="none" class="_9KQG9q_photo" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></video></div><div class="_9KQG9q_videoPanel"><div class="_9KQG9q_videoIdentity"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/fe7603bb2c1a2f3b9fd40b93648600d8f3c61d7e-55x20.svg?w=400&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" alt="Rox" class="_9KQG9q_logo"/><p class="_9KQG9q_videoTitle">How Rox Cut Account Research from a Week to Seconds with Tavily</p></div><div class="_9KQG9q_videoActions"><button type="button" class="QdTX5q_button QdTX5q_primary" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="QdTX5q_content"><span class="QdTX5q_iconContainer QdTX5q_iconStart" aria-hidden="true"><span class="QdTX5q_iconWrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3.5 3.25v9.5L11.5 8 3.5 3.25Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></span><span class="QdTX5q_label">Watch video</span></span><span class="QdTX5q_border" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><a class="QdTX5q_button QdTX5q_secondary" href="/customer-stories/rox"><span class="QdTX5q_content"><span class="QdTX5q_label">Read story</span></span><span class="QdTX5q_border" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div></div><dialog class="_9KQG9q_filmDialog" aria-label="Rox customer story video"><div class="_9KQG9q_filmInner"><button type="button" class="_9KQG9q_filmClose" aria-label="Close video"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M205.66,194.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32L128,139.31,61.66,205.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L116.69,128,50.34,61.66A8,8,0,0,1,61.66,50.34L128,116.69l66.34-66.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L139.31,128Z"></path></svg></button><video poster="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/1ae1f01cc13add0362125721f25b9a18c380893d-1920x1080.jpg?w=1600&amp;h=900&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" controls="" playsInline="" preload="none" class="_9KQG9q_film"></video></div></dialog></div></li><li class="_9KQG9q_cell _9KQG9q_cellQuote"><a class="_9KQG9q_card" href="/customer-stories/jetbrains"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/60c8291d2fb74a43f2565d450b86c7a368898c56-164x35.svg?w=400&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" alt="Jet Brains" class="_9KQG9q_logo"/><blockquote class="_9KQG9q_quoteBody"><span class="_9KQG9q_quoteMark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><span class="_9KQG9q_quoteText">Before web search, the model would hallucinate library methods it didn&#x27;t know. I ran into this myself building a Telegram integration; it was confidently wrong. Grounding it with real-time web search fixed that immediately.</span></blockquote><div class="_9KQG9q_cardFooter"><div class="LC_2HW_attribution LC_2HW_md"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/7c5e5155321fcd0f5e1e24e1d198d5212bd4e43a-538x538.jpg?w=96&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" alt="" class="LC_2HW_headshot"/><div class="LC_2HW_text"><span class="LC_2HW_name">Nick Frolov</span><span class="LC_2HW_meta">Head of Product, JetBrains</span></div></div><span class="QdTX5q_button QdTX5q_secondary _9KQG9q_readStory"><span class="QdTX5q_content"><span class="QdTX5q_label">Read story</span></span><span class="QdTX5q_border" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></a></li><li class="_9KQG9q_cell _9KQG9q_cellKpi"><a class="_9KQG9q_card" href="/customer-stories/peerbound"><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/5tlb0lxv/production/f7f525b6a44e0765e42f1f12259daa83ab74bbf8-1024x192.png?w=400&amp;q=75&amp;auto=format" alt="Peerbound" class="_9KQG9q_logo"/><p class="_9KQG9q_kpiTitle"><span class="_9KQG9q_kpiValue">100%</span><span class="_9KQG9q_kpiLabel">description accuracy, up from 20%</span></p><div class="_9KQG9q_cardFooter"><span class="QdTX5q_button QdTX5q_secondary _9KQG9q_readStory"><span class="QdTX5q_content"><span class="QdTX5q_label">Read story</span></span><span class="QdTX5q_border" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></a></li></ul></section></div><div class="page-module"><section id="benchmarks" class="uN3CKW_benchmarks "><div class="uN3CKW_header"><p class="uN3CKW_eyebrow">/benchmarks</p><h2 class="Mcjc0W_h2 ">Web search driven by research</h2></div><div class="uN3CKW_content"><div class="uN3CKW_chartAndSidebar"><div class="uN3CKW_picker" style="--accent:#ffc753ff"><div class="uN3CKW_pickerBar"><button type="button" class="uN3CKW_pickerTrigger" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false"><span class="uN3CKW_pickerName">Company Search</span><svg class="uN3CKW_pickerChevron " width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 6 8 10.5 12.5 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="uN3CKW_pickerStep" aria-label="Previous benchmark"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12.5 5.5 8 10 3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><button type="button" class="uN3CKW_pickerStep" aria-label="Next benchmark"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 12.5 10.5 8 6 3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="uN3CKW_chartSection" style="--accent:#ffc753ff"><div class="uN3CKW_chartCard"><div class="uN3CKW_badgeArea"><div class="uN3CKW_badgeSwitch"><span class="uN3CKW_badgeSwitchIndicator" style="opacity:0" aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="uN3CKW_badgeSwitchOption uN3CKW_badgeSwitchOptionActive">Overall</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="uN3CKW_badgeSwitchOption ">Profiles</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="uN3CKW_badgeSwitchOption ">Financials</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="uN3CKW_badgeSwitchOption ">News &amp; Markets</button></div></div><div class="uN3CKW_chartWrapper"><figure class="uN3CKW_chartFigure"><div class="uN3CKW_chartPlot" role="img" aria-label="Answer Quality Score × 100: Tavily advanced 92.6, Parallel advanced 91.6, Exa auto 90.9, Keenable default 90.3, Perplexity default 90.1, Brave llm-context 88.5, Linkup standard 85.0, Firecrawl v2 default 84.9, You.com default 84.0"></div><figcaption class="uN3CKW_chartCaption">Answer Quality Score × 100</figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="uN3CKW_sidebar"><div class="uN3CKW_aboutSection"><h3 class="uN3CKW_aboutTitle"><a href="https://www.tavily.com/blog/your-agent-has-the-company-name-how-much-can-it-actually-tell-you-about-it" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="uN3CKW_aboutTitleLink"><span class="uN3CKW_aboutTitleText">About this benchmark</span><span class="uN3CKW_aboutTitleIcon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p class="uN3CKW_aboutText">This benchmark evaluates how well search providers equip AI agents to answer company research questions. Built around real production query patterns, it tests factual correctness, financial accuracy, and freshness across companies worldwide.</p></div><div class="uN3CKW_methodologySection"><h3 class="uN3CKW_methodologyTitle"><a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/Tavily/tavily-company-search-benchmark" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="uN3CKW_methodologyTitleLink"><span class="uN3CKW_methodologyTitleText">Methodology</span><span class="uN3CKW_methodologyTitleIcon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><div class="uN3CKW_methodologyList" style="--methodology-accent:#ffc753ff"><p class="uN3CKW_methodologyItem">Dataset: Tavily&#x27;s Company Search benchmark</p><p class="uN3CKW_methodologyItem">Model: Same set of models for every provider; grounding provided by an AI agent using search results from all providers compared</p><p class="uN3CKW_methodologyItem">Scoring: Weighted answer quality, graded by a shared AI judge: complete (1.0), partial (0.85), related (0.15), or irrelevant (0.0)</p><p class="uN3CKW_methodologyItem">Normalization: Every provider is judged against the same provider-agnostic reference, using answers written by the shared model from that provider&#x27;s own search results</p><p class="uN3CKW_methodologyItem">Retrieval: max 10 documents per query</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="ntl9iW_statsGrid  "><div class="ntl9iW_header"><p class="ntl9iW_eyebrow">/proof is in the numbers</p><h2 class="ntl9iW_heading">Trusted in production. Proven at scale.</h2></div><div class="ntl9iW_marqueeWrapper"><div class="ntl9iW_marqueeTrack"><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#79deeb" aria-hidden="false"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">300M+</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">monthly requests handled</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#817fff" aria-hidden="false"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">99.99% uptime </span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">SLA powering mission-critical systems</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#ffc753" aria-hidden="false"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">180 ms</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">p50 on Tavily /search making us fastest on the market</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#f49eff" aria-hidden="false"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">3M+</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">developers using Tavily</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#81b09a" aria-hidden="false"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">Billions</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">of pages crawled and extracted without downtime</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#2677ff" aria-hidden="false"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">Easy to integrate</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">with your favorite frameworks and agents</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#79deeb" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">300M+</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">monthly requests handled</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#817fff" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">99.99% uptime </span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">SLA powering mission-critical systems</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#ffc753" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">180 ms</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">p50 on Tavily /search making us fastest on the market</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#f49eff" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">3M+</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">developers using Tavily</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#81b09a" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">Billions</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">of pages crawled and extracted without downtime</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="ntl9iW_statCard" style="--accent:#2677ff" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ntl9iW_statValue">Easy to integrate</span><div class="ntl9iW_cardFooter"><span class="ntl9iW_divider"><span class="ntl9iW_accentLine "></span></span><p class="ntl9iW_statDescription">with your favorite frameworks and agents</p></div><div class="ntl9iW_confettiLayer" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="page-module L8QN1a_spotlightTopSpacing"><section class="B5LJqa_spotlight "><div class="B5LJqa_header"><p class="B5LJqa_headerEyebrow">/press room</p><h2 class="B5LJqa_heading">Tavily in action</h2></div><div class="HpaKhG_group B5LJqa_navArrows B5LJqa_navArrowsHidden"><button type="button" class="HpaKhG_arrow" disabled="" aria-label="Scroll left"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 3.5L5.5 8L10 12.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></b